{"id": "34100", "title": "独身女人香", "author": "阿蛮", "category": "文学名著", "count": 38, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34100/34100s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34100.htm", "intro": "她，吴念香被毒舌室友封称为抹香鲸，举凡与丰满相关的字眼皆是她的忌讳，托公司电话跳线的福，因她美妙的声音酷似他的前女友，可口的“一八五先生”就此和她成了——纯异性朋友，也让她决心开始磨人的瘦身计划，他每每来得极巧的热线是她忌口良药，屡次动人的邀约是她的健身秘方，但为了安慰前女友将嫁作他人妇的他，她强忍刚拔牙科被麻醉的不适，赴约和他喝了第一杯咖啡，接收到他对她这友人真心的关切。好容易当她努力成为众星拱月的主角时，引来的探花采蜜人竟不是他……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34100", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2169145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2169146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2169147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2169148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2169149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2169150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2169151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2169152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2169153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2169154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2169155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2169156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2169157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2169158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2169159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2169160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2169161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2169162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2169163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2169164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2169165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2169166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2169167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2169168.html", "available": false}